  (gzip.c in gzip-1.2.4.tar.gz.)

gzip.exe is GZIP.EXE from GNU's MS-DOS distribution of gzip 1.2.4,
gzip-1.2.4.msdos.exe (https://ftp.gnu.org/gnu/gzip/), built by its
author in 1993 and packed with LZEXE 0.91. gzip16 does not change it: it
fetches it, checks it against the SHA-256 checksums in upstream/, and
tests it. It is not GR-DOS's or libc16's code. Its source is GNU gzip
1.2.4's, gzip-1.2.4.tar.gz, which each release's source archive carries
unchanged in upstream/ (BUILDING.md).

